<title>USA: Toy Biz Inc names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Toy Biz Inc names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toy Biz Inc said Monday it has named David Fremed chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Fremed most recently was the company's vice president of finance and its controller.</p>
<p>He succeeds Bobby Jenkins, the chief financial officer of Marvel Entertainment Group Inc, which has a controlling interest in Toy Biz.</p>
